// updateMapArtWorldSubChunkBlocksV147 consumes UpdateSubChunkBlocks standard-layer
// entries in one lock. Geyser uses this packet for batched Java section updates;
// ignoring it leaves the bot's world view stale for an entire run of blocks even
// while the real server/world has already rolled them back or changed them.
